  "prefLabel": "Ph 1002.09 Responsibility for Operation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1002.09 Responsibility for Operation. A wholesale drug distribution operation shall maintain a list of principals and persons in charge including officers, directors, or primary stockholders and their qualifications.\n\nSource. #12007, eff 10-22-16 (formerly Ph 309.12)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
